1
00:00:01,880 --> 00:00:05,720
Strategies you made or cloned are listed under My Strategies.

2
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:07,980
Right-click one and choose Rename.

3
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:14,040
Type the new name and click Rename.

4
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:18,460
The new name shows in the list.

5
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:21,470
Delete removes it. The supplied strategies cannot be renamed or deleted.

6
00:00:21,570 --> 00:00:27,090
You are asked to confirm, because this cannot be undone.

7
00:00:27,190 --> 00:00:29,590
It is gone from My Strategies.

